    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"My Bud, Sam\" is the ultimate interactive interface for accompaniment on long distance road trips, boasting multiple features to meet the challenges of what would otherwise be lonely road trip. Specifically designed for the challenges faced by semi-truck drivers, \"My Bud, Sam\" has a physical body that can interact with the driver on a personal level through conversation and physical action. It also has features such as GPS, truck diagnostics, and the ability to journalize and share experiences with the driver.",
